{"title":"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 18","text":"<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Problem\">Problem</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=1\" title=\"Edit section: Problem\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<figure class=\"mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=File:2006_CyMO-18.PNG\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><img src=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/0/07/2006_CyMO-18.PNG/250px-2006_CyMO-18.PNG\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"250\" height=\"282\" class=\"mw-file-element\" srcset=\"https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/0/07/2006_CyMO-18.PNG/375px-2006_CyMO-18.PNG 1.5x, https://artofproblemsolving.com/wiki/images/thumb/0/07/2006_CyMO-18.PNG/500px-2006_CyMO-18.PNG 2x\" /></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/4/d/64dd46229cdc5bb52266ec0c97063be466234e76.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$K(k,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -5px\" width=\"60\" height=\"20\" /> is the minimum point of the parabola and the parabola intersects the y-axis at the point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/5/6/8560c71ca1b78f09e33f15cf315612be099f706a.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\Gamma (0,k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"51\" height=\"18\" />.\nIf the area if the rectangle <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/b/1/6/b1668623dfb10b408e1de08ea7d0fa02dd6a3ce1.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$OAB\\Gamma$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"53\" height=\"13\" /> is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/4/5/8455f3b5cb3b4880b8c9d782a5c1f0334db819eb.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$8$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"11\" height=\"14\" />, then the equation of the parabola is\n</p><p><img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/6/3/6/636965e78445befec5a45a4b73492f1c9f4f5346.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{(A)}\\ y=\\frac{1}{2}(x+2)^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(B)}\\ y=\\frac{1}{2}(x-2)^2\\qquad\\mathrm{(C)}\\ y=x^2+2\\qquad\\mathrm{(D)}\\ y=x^2-2x+1\\qquad\\mathrm{(E)}\\ y=x^2-4x+4$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"849\" height=\"37\" />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Solution\">Solution</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=2\" title=\"Edit section: Solution\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<p>Since the parabola is symmetric about the line <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/7/6/c/76cd489e4ed056c8795eeffad7eeb06cc112c39d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$x = k$\" width=\"44\" height=\"12\" />, <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/f/f/5/ff5fb3d775862e2123b007eb4373ff6cc1a34d4e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$B$\" style=\"vertical-align: -1px\" width=\"17\" height=\"14\" /> has coordinates <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/5/4/1544de14ea4300af07d52ff0cba5a61946c8053e.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2k,k)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"50\" height=\"18\" />. The area of the rectangle is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/8/2/8/8285961e6e617fab10064c3d72c727fa68d396f4.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$k \\cdot 2k = 8 \\Longrightarrow k = 2$\" style=\"vertical-align: 0px\" width=\"158\" height=\"13\" />, so the vertex is at <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/c/0/c/c0c67f1e6c098104b1cb8f1cdd6bb16f689ac3e6.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(2,0)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />.\n</p><p>Thus, the equation of the parabola is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/1/4/c/14cec5e131b191d78d1f60c8eadea12e81846df7.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$y = a(x-2)^2$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"105\" height=\"19\" />. Plugging in point <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/4/e/0/4e0ef68f274ec95f4a8f94eebff49accdcf689ec.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$(0,2)$\" style=\"vertical-align: -4px\" width=\"38\" height=\"18\" />, we find <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/5/8/4/584468cd4c65823de9a250fe030f827bce3f7a6c.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$a = \\frac{1}{2}$\" style=\"vertical-align: -12px\" width=\"45\" height=\"37\" />, and the answer is <img src=\"//latex.artofproblemsolving.com/0/6/3/0630a19ec36e5e78a5a38b29446b59f240a3f75d.png\" class=\"latex\" alt=\"$\\mathrm{B}$\" width=\"12\" height=\"12\" />.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"See_also\">See also</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_18&amp;action=edit&amp;section=3\" title=\"Edit section: See also\">edit</a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\" style=\"clear:both; margin:0.5em auto; font-size:95%; border:1px solid black; align:center; width:60%;\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<td style=\"background:#ccf;text-align:center;\" colspan=\"3\"><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum\">2006 Cyprus MO, Lyceum</a></b> (<b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problems\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problems\">Problems</a></b>)\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Preceded&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_17\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 17\">Problem 17</a></b>\n</td>\n<td width=\"50%\" align=\"center\" rowspan=\"1\">Followed&#160;by<br /><b><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_19\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 19\">Problem 19</a></b>\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"3\" style=\"text-align:center;\"><a href=\"/wiki/index.php?title=2006_Cyprus_MO/Lyceum/Problem_1\" title=\"2006 Cyprus MO/Lyceum/Problem 1\